 "name_en": "Mass Change Manufacturing Bill of Material for Production (3LP)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Mass Change Manufacturing Bill of Material for Production (3LP)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioe80c0d62cc3740bc8d3b598c1b163446\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioe80c0d62cc3740bc8d3b598c1b163446__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">This scope item covers the material and component change-master-controlled mass change process of one or more manufacturing bills of materials (BOMs). To control the replacement date of the follow-up component or material, you first create a date effectivity-controlled change master. When you start the Where-Used List application with the component or material to replace, all BOMs are listed. To replace the component or material of one or more manufacturing BOMs, the BOMs must be selected. The change number is used to manage the phase in date.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">The change process is followed by the production process, which uses one of the changed manufacturing bills of materials in the respective change-master validity period.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioe80c0d62cc3740bc8d3b598c1b163446__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create change master</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Change change master</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Exchange a component in the manufacturing BOM</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Confirm the component replacement for the manufacturing BOM</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioe80c0d62cc3740bc8d3b598c1b163446__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Control the exchange of components in a BOM for production with change master</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Plan future changes for components or materials with date effectivity support</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>批量更改生产的制造物料清单 (3LP)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioe80c0d62cc3740bc8d3b598c1b163446\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioe80c0d62cc3740bc8d3b598c1b163446__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">此范围项目涵盖一个或多个制造物料清单 (BOM) 的物料和组件变更主数据控制的批量更改流程。要控制后续组件或物料的替换日期，首先创建日期有效性控制的变更主数据。当您使用要替换的组件或物料启动调用清单应用程序时，将列出所有物料清单。要替换一个或多个制造物料清单的组件或物料，必须选择物料清单。变更编号用于管理逐渐采用日期。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">变更流程之后是生产流程，生产流程使用在相应变更主数据有效期内更改的制造物料清单之一。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioe80c0d62cc3740bc8d3b598c1b163446__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">创建变更主数据</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">更改更改主数据</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">交换制造物料清单中的组件</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">确认制造物料清单的组件替换</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioe80c0d62cc3740bc8d3b598c1b163446__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">使用变更主数据控制生产物料清单中组件的交换。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">使用日期有效性支持计划组件或物料的未来更改。</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
